{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"sase-18d:000001:issue_created:sase-18d:c6f9db8f2ac3d85a9986ce945249fa1640aaef09bc388c5ae7ad72d39a08d703","timestamp":"2026-09-24T20:28:29Z","actor":"bbugyi200.athena.0ra","operation":"issue_created","issue_id":"sase-18d","payload":{"kind":"issue_created","issue":{"id":"sase-18d","title":"Reliable Agents-tab x kill and dismiss","status":"open","issue_type":"plan","tier":"epic","parent_id":null,"owner":"bryanbugyi34@gmail.com","assignee":"","created_at":"2026-09-24T20:28:29Z","created_by":"bbugyi200.athena.0ra","updated_at":"2026-09-24T20:28:29Z","closed_at":null,"close_reason":null,"description":"Pressing `x` on any Agents-tab node (agent, clan container, workflow, monitor, proc shell, gate, panel, group, or marked set) removes every affected row at once and it never comes back. Every process that belongs to a killed node is verifiably terminated, including descendants that left the runner's process group. This holds even if the TUI exits right after the keypress.","design":"plan:202609/x_kill_removal_reliability.md","model":"","is_ready_to_work":false,"changespec_name":"","changespec_bug_id":"","dependencies":[]}}}
